  - kind: done
    tags: [resolver]
    text: >-
      **A nested vault is its own vault** — a directory below the root carrying
      its own `.hmd/` is skipped when the workspace loads, so linting, the
      graph, rendering, and the site see none of its cards, and an import into
      it is HMD015. Ships in 0.3.1 [issue 0009]
  - kind: done
    tags: [site]
    text: >-
      **A folder note's ordinary links land on the built site** — the plugin
      registers a folder note one directory above its file, and now resolves
