## Limitations (known gaps)

```hql#eval
work
| filter(r => r.kind == "limitation")
| map(r => { "Limitation": r.text, "Why it stands": r.notes.unwrap_or(""), "Tags": r.tags | join(", "), "References": r.refs.unwrap_or("—") })
| Table(columns = ["Limitation", "Why it stands", "Tags", "References"])
| format(as = Markdown)
```
