## By tag

The number of rows that carry each tag, by kind.

```hql#eval
type Tagged { tag : String, kind : String }

fn count(items: List<Tagged>, kind: String) : Int = items | filter(x => x.kind == kind) | size

work
| flat_map(r => r.tags | map(t => Tagged(tag = t, kind = r.kind)))
| group(by = x => x.tag)
| sort(by = g => g.key)
| map(g => {
    Tag: g.key,
    Open: count(g.items, "open"),
    Broken: count(g.items, "broken"),
    Limitations: count(g.items, "limitation"),
    Done: count(g.items, "done"),
    Questions: count(g.items, "question"),
  })
| Table(columns = ["Tag", "Open", "Broken", "Limitations", "Done", "Questions"])
| format(as = Markdown)
```
